OL,3,GNEWSAMum urges young women to check for
OL,4,Aovarian cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young mum who was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fincurable ovarian cancer has urged
OL,8,Fother women to be aware of the disease
OL,9,Fand its symptoms, regardless of their
OL,10,Fage.
OL,12,FAlex Littlewood, 25, from Huddersfield,
OL,13,Fwas told she had the illness in June
OL,14,Fthis year, just months after she gave
OL,15,Fbirth to her daughter, Tilly.
OL,17,FAccording to the NHS, ovarian cancer
OL,18,Fmostly affects women over the age of
OL,19,F50, but Alex - who is now undergoing
OL,20,Fintensive chemotherapy - said her
OL,21,Fexperience showed younger women were
OL,22,Falso at risk.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
